---
/**
 * Place right after a static list of places sorted at build time with sortSitesByRoute (lib/data) whose items carry
 * routeAttrs: re-sorts them by route day against the viewer's clock before first paint (window.routeSort, Base.astro).
 */
---
<script is:inline>window.routeSort && routeSort(document.currentScript.previousElementSibling);</script>
